    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Palianytsia</strong> is a game where you play as an ordinary, at first glance, palianytsia that unexpectedly finds itself in a mysterious world where reality begins to change around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything seems bright and peaceful, but the further you progress, the more signs appear that this world holds its own secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The palianytsia gradually undergoes mysterious mutations that affect its appearance and abilities. Your goal is to uncover the secrets of the world, understand what causes these metamorphoses, and find the path to discovering its true nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Mysterious Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cozy kitchens and bakeries to gloomy laboratories, each place hides its own secrets and interactive objects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/7727d46cbf4388c87f15d1fc21476560.poster.avif?t=1753440301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/7727d46cbf4388c87f15d1fc21476560.webp?t=1753440301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, interact with objects, search for clues, and avoid dangers that may lurk around every corner.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/1428834bc1171c698fc4b0081f34af52.poster.avif?t=1753440301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/1428834bc1171c698fc4b0081f34af52.webp?t=1753440301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gradual Changes and Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, the palianytsia mutates, acquiring new forms and abilities that unlock new mechanics and puzzles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/67d107e0032f95b721bf14b2b4d834a2.poster.avif?t=1753440301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/67d107e0032f95b721bf14b2b4d834a2.webp?t=1753440301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Palianytsia</strong> is a game where you play as an ordinary, at first glance, palianytsia that unexpectedly finds itself in a mysterious world where reality begins to change around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything seems bright and peaceful, but the further you progress, the more signs appear that this world holds its own secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The palianytsia gradually undergoes mysterious mutations that affect its appearance and abilities. Your goal is to uncover the secrets of the world, understand what causes these metamorphoses, and find the path to discovering its true nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Mysterious Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cozy kitchens and bakeries to gloomy laboratories, each place hides its own secrets and interactive objects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/7727d46cbf4388c87f15d1fc21476560.poster.avif?t=1753440301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/7727d46cbf4388c87f15d1fc21476560.webp?t=1753440301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, interact with objects, search for clues, and avoid dangers that may lurk around every corner.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/1428834bc1171c698fc4b0081f34af52.poster.avif?t=1753440301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/1428834bc1171c698fc4b0081f34af52.webp?t=1753440301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gradual Changes and Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, the palianytsia mutates, acquiring new forms and abilities that unlock new mechanics and puzzles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/67d107e0032f95b721bf14b2b4d834a2.poster.avif?t=1753440301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732030/extras/67d107e0032f95b721bf14b2b4d834a2.webp?t=1753440301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 /></picture></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In this game, you are a palianytsia \u2014 a traditional Ukrainian bread. You escape the kitchen, solve puzzles, and uncover your true nature. What begins as a bright, cheerful journey slowly turns into horror as you try to understand what\u2019s really going on.",
